Checkpoint Fabric

Copyright © Summon Software Labs

Checkpoint Fabric is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for governing the
survival and resumption of execution state across heterogeneous AI
infrastructure.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Checkpoint Fabric does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Checkpoint Fabric accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on
the terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
